                                        "entry_id": "f077be89-1c07-3a4c-8156-6fcc4ad925e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The slightly flatter region, on either side of the head of a vertebrate, including a human, behind the eye and forehead, above the zygomatic arch, and forward of the ear."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fb5cc39-468c-4171-a21a-3d6d23674dd9",
                                                "sense_id": "0b458048-74cc-3acd-8dfe-b160ee6a6851",
                                                "text": "Then Iael Hebers wife, tooke a naile of the tent, and tooke an hammer in her hand, and went softly vnto him, and smote the naile into his temples, and fastened it into the ground: (for he was fast asleepe, and weary;) so he died."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91db8868-2b1c-4faa-874b-efcddb0bf329",
                                                "sense_id": "0b458048-74cc-3acd-8dfe-b160ee6a6851",
                                                "text": "Biblical criteria of sexual seductiveness include a white skin, black hair, or henna-dyed, scarlet lips, a prominent nose, rosy temples, long straight neck, firm breasts, round thighs, an erect posture."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c78352fa-67f9-4962-a214-c9a8341e9aa3",
                                                "sense_id": "0b458048-74cc-3acd-8dfe-b160ee6a6851",
                                                "text": "A few days after the electrodes were implanted, Bennett welcomed visitors into his hospital room. His head is wrapped in bandages. A thick braid of wires hangs from his left temple."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb2a97c5-e7f2-370d-8ea1-1eecccf3b9b4",
